config-traffic	p	This is how containers send traffic outside of Cloud Foundry and receive traffic from outside, the Internet.	L177 app_runtime_abbr
config-traffic	li	Application Security Groups (ASGs) apply network traffic rules at the container level. For more information about ASGs, see App Security Groups.	L181 app_sec_groups_link: a Markdown value at the end of a list item
