config-traffic	li	Within Cloud Foundry, apps can communicate directly with each other, but the containers are isolated from outside Cloud Foundry. For information about administering container-to-container network policies, see Configuring Container-to-Container Networking.	L183 app_runtime_abbr twice, container_network_link: an HTML value at the end of a list item
