security	li	Only allowing outbound connections to public addresses from app containers. This is the original default. Admins can change this behavior by configuring ASGs. For more information about ASGs, see App Security Groups.	L193 app_sec_groups_default, app_sec_groups_link: two values side by side, text and Markdown, as a whole list item
